# Health & OpenAPI — chọn environment: local-direct | local-gateway
@gateway = {{gateway}}

### Gateway Swagger (WebFlux)
GET {{gateway}}/swagger-ui.html

### Gateway — OpenAPI catalog qua Eureka
GET {{gateway}}/v3/api-docs/catalog-service

### Catalog — trực tiếp (local-direct: catalog = :8082)
GET {{catalog}}/v3/api-docs

### Auth — trực tiếp
GET {{auth}}/v3/api-docs
